WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.626
Coordinator (British female): Good afternoon, Riverside Arts Centre.

00:00:02.966 --> 00:00:05.668
Caller (British male): Hello. I'd like to book an evening course.

00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:08.548
Coordinator (British female): Of course. Can I take your surname?

00:00:08.768 --> 00:00:12.491
Caller (British male): Patel. P, A, T, E, L.

00:00:12.741 --> 00:00:14.253
Coordinator (British female): Which course interests you?

00:00:14.473 --> 00:00:18.007
Caller (British male): I first considered photography, but I'd prefer pottery.

00:00:18.307 --> 00:00:23.424
Coordinator (British female): The pottery course starts on the sixth of November, not the fourth as shown in the old leaflet.

00:00:23.724 --> 00:00:24.572
Caller (British male): That's fine.

00:00:24.822 --> 00:00:30.996
Coordinator (British female): The full fee is eighty-five pounds. The ninety-five-pound figure includes an optional exhibition ticket.

00:00:31.296 --> 00:00:32.285
Caller (British male): What is included?

00:00:32.505 --> 00:00:44.118
Coordinator (British female): All basic materials are included, and students may use the evening studio without extra charge. Tools can be hired, refreshments are sold downstairs, and parking costs four pounds.

00:00:44.538 --> 00:00:46.331
Caller (British male): How will I receive the timetable?

00:00:46.551 --> 00:00:51.325
Coordinator (British female): We'll email it this afternoon. Your membership card must be collected at reception.

00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:53.450
Caller (British male): What time does the class begin?

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:58.503
Coordinator (British female): At six thirty. The building opens at six and the tutor arrives at six fifteen.

00:00:58.803 --> 00:01:04.521
Caller (British male): Perfect. I chose this centre because the classes are small, so I should receive more feedback.

00:01:04.821 --> 00:01:06.345
Coordinator (British female): I'll reserve your place now.
